      "content": "it feels like you're just saying what people are supposed to say. \"one small stone\"... i don't have any stones left. i don't even have the energy to pick one up. it's not just about the career, it's that the person who was capable of building things is dead. there's nothing left to shape. it feels more like a permanent end than a transition. like, is it even logical to keep trying when the core of who you were is just gone?",
